# Secrets. .env holds the live database password, JWT/QR secrets and Stripe
# keys — it was previously ignored only by luck (never staged), which one
# `git add .` would have undone. .env.example stays tracked as the template,
# and .env.test carries throwaway test credentials only.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example
!.env.test
